From 519afad74e66cbcd6d55060835b57f0fffd47525 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jempa <jempamartensson@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 19:40:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 09/41] Light linking and shadow linking in volpath (for
 hdPbrt)

Shapes take "integer hdpbrtlinks" [collection indices 0..63] (their membership; [-1] for
none), lights "integer hdpbrtlightlink" and "integer hdpbrtshadowlink" (a collection).
VolPathIntegrator skips a light at surfaces outside its light-link collection, both for
light samples and for emission found by BSDF sampling (the previous vertex's mask), and
shadow rays pass through surfaces outside the light's shadow-link collection.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
